818057f_20260505_110742/report.json:1340:    \"description\": \"只重着色那些连通分量恰好为5像素的孤立'+'（即十字形连通分量）。同时额外检查：如果大的非对称连通分量中有嵌入的'+',则忽略它们；只有完美对称的孤立十字形才被重着色。解题者需要做连通分量分析+对称性验证的双重过滤。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/make_7b3084d4_variants.py:25:    (\"D8\", \"2\"): (\"D8 — 拼图块分割方式（tab结构） (meta)\", \"交叉分割（十字形）\", \"cross5\"),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a25697e4_20260502_195415/report.json:291:    \"description\": \"框架凹槽为T形或十字形(有2-4个分支)。工具上有标记像素(小色点)，标记数量等于凹槽分支数。配对规则：工具标记数=凹槽分支数决定匹配。对接方式不变：plug填凹槽，handle突出。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_a25697e4_20260502_195415/report.json:1202:    \"description\": \"工具有内部空心洞。框架凹槽为T形/十字形。配对规则：工具空心洞的数量等于凹槽的分支数(T形=3分支，十字=4分支)。plug(含洞)填入凹槽，洞保留为背景。handle突出。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_136b0064_20260506_043117/report.json:1998:    \"description\": \"每个字形由两种颜色组成，一种颜色编码方向，面积决定长度，折线段输出颜色由长度映射决定。形成颜色→方向+面积→长度→输出颜色的多通道编码。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc2_mechanism_tags_raw.json:95:    {\"tag\": \"corridor_following\", \"field\": \"path\", \"context\": \"water channel wide enough to pass through\"},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc2_mechanism_tags_raw.json:152:    {\"tag\": \"corridor_following\", \"field\": \"path\", \"context\": \"empty space between two parallel bars of same color\"},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/arc2_mechanism_tags_raw.json:154:    {\"tag\": \"particle_movement\", \"field\": \"src\", \"context\": \"magenta particle pixel at corridor entrances\"}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/audit_combo_88e364bc.json:378:    \"name\": \"宽通道约束+L/T形区域\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/review_pack_1ae2feb7.json:5822:    \"alt_name\": \"涂色扩展为十字形\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/review_pack_1ae2feb7.json:5823:    \"description\": \"每个周期涂点不仅涂自身行的格子，还同时涂上下相邻行的格子（形成垂直的短竖线或十字形标记）。这让不同行的涂色产生空间重叠，增加了行间交互的复杂度。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_stable_bf45cf4b/17.py:82:# - Objects are first placed in a roomy local canvas and tested exhaustively.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_800d221b_20260502_075558/report.md:9:| 800d221b | 15 | D2/2+