\": \"光晕为十字形，两个缺陷光晕重叠时重叠像素不着色。十字面积小（4像素），互斥后可能仅剩2-3个点。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_71e489b6_20260507_030631/report.json:1403:    \"description\": \"十字形光晕标记，内部缺陷用橙色十字，叶子用品红色十字，毛刺用品红单点。品红色的十字和点需通过形态区分。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_71e489b6_20260507_030631/report.json:1474:    \"description\": \"缺陷大小同时编码在三个通道：光晕半径、光晕颜色、中心标记（红色）。三重冗余编码使规则更容易发现但整体更复杂。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_71e489b6_20260507_030631/report.json:1686:    \"description\": \"蓝色区域中任何非蓝色像素触发十字形光晕，但光晕只覆写蓝色像素。非蓝色缺陷周围如果有黑色像素不会变橙色。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_71e489b6_20260507_030631/report.json:1895:    \"description\": \"8连通检测连通分量，只标记蓝黑边界上的缺陷像素，十字形光晕。三步改变了分量划分、目标筛选、标记形态。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_16b78196_merged_report.json:1193:    \"description\": \"杆为两种颜色交替的条纹图案且呈十字形（非直线），缺口分布在四个方向的臂上。条纹方向与臂的朝向可能不同，精灵需填入条纹缺口时考虑条纹对齐。solver需在四个方向上分别处理链生长，同时理解条纹模式如何影响缺口的视觉呈现。\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8f3a5a89_20260502_115644/report.md:11:| 8f3a5a89 | 9 | D1/2+D11/2 | 通道宽度约束洪填+迷宫墙壁 | D1/2 | 50/50 | ✓ |\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/5b37cb25.py:77:    assert h >= 5 and w >= 5, \"expected room for a frame and plus notches\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6bcdb01e.py:11:    Extend the edge-touching green start bar through the corridor, turning at each teal blocker until the path leaves the grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6bcdb01e.py:23:    Key insight: The blocker pixels define a one-cell-wide corridor, so every interior collision has exactly one valid 90-degree turn.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6bcdb01e.py:169:        fwd_room = _max_forward(r, c, chosen_dir[0], chosen_dir[1], H, W)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6bcdb01e.py:170:        if fwd_room < MIN_FWD_AFTER_TURN:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/6bcdb01e.py:173:        if remaining_turns > 0 and fwd_room < MIN_FWD_WITH_REMAINING_TURNS:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_8f3a5a89_20260502_115644/report.json:569:    \"name\": \