eshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/14/code.py:214:      a colored cell, turn 90 degrees into the unique perpendicular valid corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/14/code.py:219:      the heading is encoded geometrically by unequal corridor continuation lengths around\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/14/code.py:579:    \"\"\"Replace edge starts with interior starts inferred from unequal corridor arms.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/1/code.py:3:# Name: 连接器配对十字形标记+方向标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/1/code.py:48:      The connector runs only through the interior corridor at least 2 cells away\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/1/code.py:79:      interior connector corridor and room for a length-2 inward arm.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/1/code.py:86:      rows rmin+2 / rmax-2. These corridors stay clear of the decoy corners.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:8:#      upper area remains the striped bar/corridor maze from 9bbf930d.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:9:#    - Each corridor color receives a same-color 2x2 L-shaped legend glyph:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:21:#      corridors exists. This combo: both exist, legend color 4 says CCW/CW, so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:29:#    - The same corridor colors repeat across multiple rows and the legend shows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:30:#      all used corridor colors, so humans get repeated support for the mapping.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:32:#      the maze itself; only one target dot is placed per moving real path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:38:#    - Original `_has_corridor()` and forward motion assumed only BG/PARTICLE are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/5/code.py:40:#    - O