  b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8698868d/13/code.py:81:- Canvas dimensions are chosen so the frame grid fits and there is still room for all sprites.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/7/code.py:48:#    8-connected wall component fully inside the corridor. Movers are chosen only from cells inside the nominal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/7/code.py:390:    - One small non-wall component sits inside one enclosure and acts as the fill seed. Additional non-wall singleton pixels are isolated movers placed in the outward fill corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/25/code.py:31:    - 原题/阻挡逻辑里：A 的 BR 会先占住通道，B 的 TL 在第一批已画像素处就停止，C 也只会被更早像素截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/25/code.py:32:    - 本融合里：A 先向 SE 画完整条通道；随后 B 的 TL 从反方向沿同一组对角线往 NW 走，不会被 A 挡住，而是把共享区段改成 B 的颜色；再之后 C 会把它与 B 共用的那部分再改成 C 的颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/25/code.py:256:      Earlier rays can be recolored by later diamonds, so the final shared corridors are owned by the last diamond in positional order.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8698868d/16/code.py:36:#    The generator reserves canvas room for both the frame grid and scattered sprites, keeps at least one-cell outer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/53fb4810/D6/2/code.py:21:#    corridor only until the top right '+' is reached. The old logic would keep\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/53fb4810/D6/2/code.py:27:#    perimeter. Every sample therefore contains multiple plus-to-plus corridors,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/53fb4810/D6/2/code.py:54:#    Rays occupy four separate rectangle edges, so no two rays share a corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/53fb4810/D6/2/code.py:228:    - The marker's attachment side still determines the ray direction, but the endpoint is no longer the canvas edge; it is the first later '+' encountered on the same aligned corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/0/code.py:403:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/0/code.py:404:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/0/code.py:406:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/0/code.py:407:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/0/code.py:59:  new solver must validate the entire post-source ray corridor to the border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/0/code.py:88:long border-reaching corridors. Simpler shape mixtures and a lower shadow density keep\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/0/code.py:99:1. Each intended shape must have clear ray corridors from every emitting vertex to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/21/code.py:69:# - The reserve box also contains the travel corridor, preventing unrelated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/32/code.py:65:#    the no-mover dashed solver would fill, are not on the border, have enough room\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/32/code.py:76:#    Their trails only carve through the already-filled corridor, avoiding additional\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/1/code.py:50:#    away from every segment corridor so they do not create accidental clutter.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/1/code.py:408:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/1/code.py:409:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/1/code.py:411:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/1/code.py:412:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:18:#     outward direction is (-1, +1), and each endpoint paints a full diagonal corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:26:#   - transform change: sparse boundary markers replace long colored corridors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:30:#   - D12 alone would crop a board whose rays are still thick colored corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:41:# - Full hidden ray corridors are still reserved during placement. This avoids ambiguous\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:62:# - Each candidate placement also reserves the entire hidden ray corridors inside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:76:# - Sparse markers are cleaner than long ray corridors, but could become confusing if\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/27/code.py:194:    \"\"\"Return the boundary terminal if the whole hidden corridor stays background.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:3:# Name: 锥形辐射+瓶颈通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:10:#     - 颈部两侧是平行短墙，颈内通道宽度只取 1 或 2；两端点位于颈口外端，仍是整个墙组件唯一的两个 degree-1 像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:16:#     - 本融合: 颜色先以瓶颈宽度穿过通道；离开颈口后的前几步仍保持窄束，随后边界按固定节奏逐层外扩。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:19:#     - 只保留两个主自由度: 通道宽度 {1,2} 与腔室张口宽度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:23:#     - 原 solver 假设端点附近的墙走向就是外侧边界走向；这里失效，因为端点只标记通道出口。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:28:#     - 生成器只构造一个 8 连通墙组件，固定两端点，确保通道和瓶身不自交。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:287:    corridor_width = random.choice(CORRIDOR_WIDTHS)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:290:        widen_total = base_span - (corridor_width + 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:308:    left_corridor = [(u, neck_left) for u in range(CORRIDOR_LEN + 1)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:309:    right_corridor = [(u, neck_right) for u in range(CORRIDOR_LEN + 1)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:313:    pts = set(left_corridor) | set(right_corridor) | set(left_body) | set(right_body)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/4/code.py:3:# Name: 十字形精灵+旋转放入\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/4/code.py:75:#    - Shared anchors leave enough horizontal room for both upright and rotated placements.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/28/code.py:38:# - \"Path cells are background\" is invalid because 8-blocks occupy the corridor and participate in motion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/28/code.py:47:# - The obstacle is always fully inside the lane's sweep corridor and always ahead of the front container.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/28/code.py:52:# - A human also sees that an obstacle sits inside the same corridor and that output either moves the obstacle\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/28/code.py:67:#   Generator guarantee: every 8-block is placed fully inside the lane corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:16:#    阶梯圆弧和上下两条短连接桥组成，视觉上像一个圆弧形的细围栏通道。填充种子放在两条弧之间的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:17:#    通道里。原题是从唯一开口整体向一个方向辐射；融合后固定保留两个开口: 一个开在外弧上，一个开在\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:19:#    弧形通道，再从两个开口分别漏出成两条方向不同的条带。与原题相比，开口识别从“找两个端点”变成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:38:#    人类能直接看见两件新现象: 第一，围栏不再是直角 U，而是近似圆弧通道；第二，输出里会同时出现\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:48:#    不变。唯一的颜色变化仍是“背景 -> 填充色”，而变化区域明显由弧形通道与多条缺口带共同决定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:378:    - A small fill-color seed lies inside the curved corridor between the arcs. Any remaining non-bg non-wall pixels are obstacles.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:380:    - Flood-fill the corridor reachable from the seed, then continue through every detected fence gap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:54:#      multiple beam colors in the same corridor would make the output visually messy.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:380:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:381:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:383:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:384:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/27/code.py:30:#   its canonical elbow forces a detour through a nearby corridor, so its full route\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/13/code.py:37:# - 输入 assembly 仍采用原题 corridor：dest + gap + head + container。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:77:#    border. Trail interactions happen in open background corridors, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:295:    room = axis - sz - 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:296:    if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:298:    a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:299:    b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/11/code.py:39:      本来会走过但最终保持背景的通道，从而避免逻辑退化和视觉遮挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/11/code.py:55:    - solver 新增假设：inactive 边外侧若按原题发射，本应能走出一段背景通道；generator 为其保留完整空走廊，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:395:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:396:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:398:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:399:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/22/code.py:70:  - Each whole assembly (destination + gap corridor + head + container) is placed\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/22/code.py:73:    the moved container stays within the same reserved corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:66:- `_flood_room()` 假设种子在 bbox 内部: generator 从内部种子池中选点并扩成小 blob。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:244:def _flood_room(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:254:    room_mask = np.zeros_like(comp_mask, dtype=bool)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:256:        room_mask[r0 + 1:r1, c0 + 1:c1] = True\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:257:    passable = room_mask & (~comp_mask) & ((g == bg) | (g == fill))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:365:    room_seen = _flood_room(g, comp_mask, bbox, bg, fill, fill_pos)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:366:    filled_mask = room_seen & (g == bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/28/code.py:50:#    bbox clearance. Parameters are chosen so all initial beam corridors are background-only, the first beam\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/12/code.py:73:#   of crowding the path corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/6/code.py:53:#   - Assemblies reserve the original corridor: destination + gap + head + container.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/0/code.py:56:#     - the source square is placed so the hooked early beam has room to reach all three planned obstacles and so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/16/code.py:38:#      inside the corridor would incorrectly puncture the filled region before it moves.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/16/code.py:46:#    Humans can see the same corridor logic as the base task, plus repeated local motifs:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/16/code.py:401:    - The wall still determines both the filled corridor and the motion axis. After that, component size separates dynamic singletons from static obstacle sprites, and arrival order along the shared axis explains which mover color survives on each obstacle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/1/code.py:57:#      one-bend candidates while leaving one shortest 2-bend corridor open.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:59:  - 只强制单通道覆盖，减少同一区域多层交叉\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/9/code.py:17:#      two endpoints, and the outgoing corridor is bounded by invisible rays.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/9/code.py:21:#    - D8/2 makes the previously implicit corridor boundary visible as wall.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/9/code.py:60:#      and the opposite side has room for the seed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:35:#       - the visible output is one long bent corridor rather than a cross\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:308:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:309:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:311:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:312:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/26/code.py:276:    \"\"\"Largest fill length that still leaves room for the right cap within width 10.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/10/code.py:24:#         step 1: left funnel fills and emits its wedge into the corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/10/code.py:62:#      output change clearly depends on the corridor hit.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/10/code.py:67:#      omits them in normal samples to keep the central corridor legible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:94:#   on clear movement corridors. The generator constructs isolated assemblies to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/13/code.py:40:#      clearance, so frames are recoverable and rays have unobstructed launch corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D10/1/code.py:376:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D10/1/code.py:377:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D10/1/code.py:379:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D10/1/code.py:380:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/26/code.py:21:#      now swallows the cue, especially on a 15x15 canvas where there is almost no spare room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/26/code.py:42:#      enough room for those exact side-attached patches.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:27:#     - 因此输出里会多出一段穿过障碍的青色通道，而且后续横向/纵向段的起点会平移一个“障碍厚度”的距离。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:43:#     - 人眼能直接看到“障碍里面出现青色通道”以及“转弯点从近侧移到远侧”这两个视觉证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:418:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:419:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:421:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:422:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/4/code.py:39:   and the mouth corridor is empty in the input.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/4/code.py:44:   enough outward room to show several stripe alternations. Seeds are still\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/16/code.py:35:#   2. the informative border width is 4, because the legend needs room for up to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:352:        room = axis - sz - OBS_BOTH_GAP\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:353:        if room < 2 * lo:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:355:        a = random.randint(lo, min(hi_cap, room - lo))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:356:        b = _rand_thickness(lo, min(hi_cap, room - a))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/19/code.py:56:     corridors, and reserves every corridor cell, including skipped cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/19/code.py:57:   - Candidate placements are rejected if any corridor cell overlaps another segment,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/19/code.py:58:     diamond, or ray corridor, or if any emitter lacks the required post-path boundary\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/5/code.py:18:#   valid, so the barrier rays still define the corridor, but passability is capped by a forward\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/4/code.py:163:    # Require extra room so this combo never collapses to \"extend until boundary\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:3:# Name: 连通分量计数+行列互换+多色控制通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:23:#          另一个颜色只在本象限出现，充当干扰通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:24:#       2) D1/2: 真正控制尺寸的不是像素数，而是这条共享颜色通道在该象限里的 4 邻接连通分量数。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:34:#     - 若左右控制区都有许多共同颜色，人类难以判断目标通道；因此限制为“恰有一个共享颜色 +\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:50:#       “先分离颜色通道”的结构线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/25/code.py:56:#     - 每个控制象限只用两种非黑色，避免上方通道过多导致画面嘈杂。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/10/code.py:3:# Name: 十字形标记+两层嵌套恢复\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:72:#     side corridor, not diagonally ambiguous. The generator exposes all four\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:73:#     side corridors by keeping the board near the canvas center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:80:#     positions, leaving all four side corridors legal inside the 20x20 canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:93:#   - Cues live in sparse side corridors rather than in diagonal clutter, so both\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:106:#   - Each cue must occupy a legal top/right/bottom/left corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/11/code.py:300:    - Small same-color cue sprites sit outside the board, each occupying one clear board side corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/34/code.py:314:    - The wall geometry still determines the only legal filled corridor, but the output color no longer comes from one seed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D5/1/code.py:41:#   stays inside its reserved corridor and away from other objects by at least one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/7/code.py:29:#       internal room count equals the desired rotation (1, 2, or 3).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/7/code.py:83:#         2. the decisive variation is how many enclosed rooms those silhouettes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/7/code.py:89:#     - Cue families are monochrome and separated from each other, so hole rooms\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/36/code.py:20:#    isolated pixels are then interpreted as movers on that radiating corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/36/code.py:30:#    pixels move upward, erase their source-color corridor to bg, and the upper\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/36/code.py:67:#    corridor between a source and its target, so filled regions, walls, and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/36/code.py:387:    - Each wall sprite has its own nearby seed component inside the enclosure, plus some isolated non-seed pixels on the outward corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/36/code.py:733:    # filled corridor back to bg, and both targets end with non-seed colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/23/code.py:218:#   If a later ray crosses that same corridor, the later color replaces the earlier one.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:853:    corridor = random.randint(*PAIR_GAP_RANGE)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:858:            max_left = w - depth - corridor - 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:862:            c_right = c_left + corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:867:        max_right = w - depth - corridor - 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:871:        c_left = c_right + corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:879:        max_top = h - depth - corridor - 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:883:        r_bottom = r_top + corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:888:    max_bottom = h - depth - corridor - 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:892:    r_top = r_bottom + corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/bf45cf4b/17/code.py:79:# - Objects are first placed in a roomy local canvas and tested exhaustively.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/0/code.py:549:    room_h = 26 - need_top - need_bottom - cluster_h\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/0/code.py:550:    room_w = 26 - need_left - need_right - cluster_w\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/0/code.py:551:    if room_h < 2 or room_w < 2:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/0/code.py:554:    extra_h = random.randint(2, min(8, room_h))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/0/code.py:555:    extra_w = random.randint(2, min(8, room_w))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:25:      boundary_behavior: the ray still cannot leave the grid, so visibility is min(budget, boundary room)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:37:    paints exactly six diagonal cells (if there is room): A, B, A, B, A, B, then stops even if the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:67:    Boundary-clipped 2-pixel segments in the original geometry usually have almost no outward room,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/2/code.py:474:    \"\"\"Pick a corner anchor and return the two cue corridors available around that corner placement.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D4/3/code.py:85:# 3. Marker arms have room to remain legible. The generator enforces this by larger\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/21/code.py:253:    \"\"\"Largest fill length that still leaves room for the bottom cap.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:19:#     - 障碍物保留原色，并按“通道阻断”处理：粗射线的 3 条并行通道分别独立前进，某一通道碰到障碍或墙后，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:20:#       该通道更远处不再着色，其他通道继续。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:25:#     - 若某列通道在第 5 层撞到障碍，则该列的第 5 层本身保留障碍色，且第 6 层以后这一路都停止；旁边两列仍可继续。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:32:#     - 原 solver 的阴影扫描基于连续 filled_mask；这里改成逐通道直射，因此阻挡要在射线追踪时在线处理，而不能事后扫线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:33:#     - “粗射线宽度为 3” 隐含要求：seed 对齐的 3 条通道必须都能穿过开口。generator 通过选择具有 3 格净空走廊的 seed 保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:37:#     - seed 仅放在局部 interior 中，且其所在列/行以及相邻两条并行通道从 seed 到开口全程无墙，保证 3 宽射线物理可通过。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:419:    \"\"\"Pick interior cells near the closed end whose 3-lane corridor to the opening is clear.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/30/code.py:34:#    matching closed end, and grid margins guarantee room for the reverse-direction motion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D2/0/code.py:51:#      because the generator keeps the whole motion corridor inside one assembly bbox.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D2/0/code.py:54:#    - The input assembly bbox from the original task already spans the full corridor:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/12/code.py:18:#    wall pocket, the wall plus the two endpoint rays define the corridor, and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/12/code.py:394:    - Compute the same reachable region as the original task: the wall and endpoint rays define the corridor, and obstacles cut away straight shadows along the radiate direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D15/2/code.py:35:#   one patch: a distractor pixel is inserted onto a line's direct corridor so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/18/code.py:67:#     * left pane: blue marks the exact horizontal travel corridor of each moving sprite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/18/code.py:177:    Key insight: The same separator-adjacent hole rows still decide which rows fire, but the output now also exposes the travel corridor on the left, while the right-side ray length is encoded by the width of the flush black emitter rather than extending to the border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/_final_summary_20260516.json:53:    \"name\": \"颜色通道轮换 + 三组三向交换\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/_final_summary_20260516.json:236:    \"notes\": \"50/50 parent retest passed after parent tightened corridor-validity checks in generator\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/_final_summary_20260516.json:267:    \"name\": \"颜色通道轮换 + 链式传递 + 三组结构\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/32/code.py:91:#      That leaves enough room to show multi-cell rows/columns and to keep the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D2/2/code.py:89:  in the corridor and the moved head ends flush against it.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D13/0/code.py:88:Only one contested corridor is forced per grid. Other shapes, if present, are placed with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/26/code.py:250:    assert valid, \"emitter needs room for a hole and two walls\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D8/1/code.py:74:#   single compact object instead of stacking many symbols in one corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/23/code.py:57:#      interior into a dense maze.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/40/code.py:3:# Name: 模板色由控制位置决定+多色控制通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/22/code.py:54:   - The generator fixes four exterior corridor rows/columns: the U-pair stays\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/22/code.py:87:     corridors to fit legally.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/22/code.py:895:    \"\"\"One L-path inside plus a farther outside corridor that stays clear of U-pairs.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/22/code.py:937:def _place_components_with_random_corridors(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/14/code.py:417:    \"\"\"Return the board sides that have enough room for any cue patch.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/14/code.py:432:    \"\"\"Pick a board top-left position with room on at least two cue sides.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D18/0/code.py:45:#    - `generate_input()` 通过 reserved corridors 和非边界 placement 保证这些前提成立。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/24/code.py:78:#     sep >= 5 leaves room for a 4-column sprite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/24/code.py:368:    assert max_sw >= 4, \"separator must leave room for width-2 nozzle variants\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D1/0/code.py:87:#       - motion corridors remain clear\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/24/code.py:3:# Name: 颜色通道轮换 + 链式传递 + 三组结构\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dbff022c/24/code.py:66:#       height enough to preserve room for interior sprites.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:19:#     - D11/2 要求把配对精灵之间原本留白的背景 corridor 填成两个原型共有的颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:20:#     - D14/1 要求再在同一条 corridor 上画出交换路径；为了让双重效果都可见，路径不再占满整条带，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:21:#       而是叠在 corridor 中央的一条单像素线，并按左右/上下来源拆成两段颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:26:#     - 差异不是“多画一个独立标记”，而是把 D11 的面状填充与 D14 的线状路径叠在同一 corridor 上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:28:#     - 如果仍允许 3-4 个对象自由散布，solver 无法知道哪两个对象之间该出现 corridor。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:33:#     - 原 solver 默认“清空旧对象并贴上新对象就结束”；现在必须在互换之后再处理 pair corridor。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:34:#     - 原 generator 默认对象间只需互不重叠；现在还要保证同尺度 pair 之间存在一条干净 corridor，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:35:#       并且这条 corridor 在输出中不会与别的 pair 的填充/路径相撞。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:40:#     - 若 corridor 只有 1 像素厚，中央路径会完全遮住填充；因此模板和配对几何都选成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:43:#     - pair patch 在局部先同时容纳输入对象、交换后的输出对象和中间 corridor，再整体随机放入画布。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:45:#     - 输出视觉上分三层：精灵本体、shared-color corridor、中央双向路径线；三层边界清楚，不会糊在一起。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:143:    \"\"\"Fill the pair corridor with the shared color, then overlay the bidirectional path line.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:186:    assert False, \"pair corridor must be horizontal or vertical with positive gap and overlap\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:293:    Swap every sprite to the opposite prototype, then turn each paired gap into a filled exchange corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:297:    - Sprites appear in two same-scale A/B pairs; each pair is arranged either left-right or top-bottom with a clean empty corridor between them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:301:    - For each same-scale pair, fill the corridor between the swapped sprites using the unique non-anchor color shared by both prototypes, then overlay a central two-part path line using the pair's two transfer colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/21/code.py:304:    - The anchor box still solves the original identification problem, while the tightened pair geometry makes the new behavior deterministic: once same-scale partners are known, the extra work is just “swap first, then decorate the unique corridor between them with shared-fill area plus a split transfer line”.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/11/code.py:30:#     border. The generator guarantees this by using disjoint cardinal corridors with one spoke per seed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/11/code.py:34:#     and branch corridors are disjoint, so no accidental merges or out-of-bounds placements occur.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/7/code.py:283:        assert c0 <= c1, \"horizontal pair must have a positive corridor\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/7/code.py:295:        assert r0 <= r1, \"vertical pair must have a positive corridor\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/7/code.py:420:    - For the four-sprite group, pair each sprite with the farthest compatible opposite-type sprite and draw a two-color trail for each pair; for the single A/B pair, draw the direct corridor trail between them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/5/code.py:3:# Name: 颜色通道轮换 + 三组三向交换\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/5/code.py:9:#    - 这个融合版把“类”改成 3 个颜色相位组：同一结构模板上有 3 个变量通道角色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/5/code.py:18:#      “三相位分组识别 + 沿相位环 A->B->C->A 推进一步”，这一步恰好等价于通道轮换\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D16/0/code.py:74:  - Because the input assembly already spans the full travel corridor, keeping it\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e453dd6/15/code.py:36:# - The right pane is widened to 5-7 columns. This is enough room for diagonal travel, visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/15/code.py:3:# Name: hub整体着色+十字形hub\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:18:     plus a vertical divider, splitting the lower playfield into left/right rooms. The\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:24:       monochrome room divider from consideration. After that, recover the two normalized\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:54:   - Sprites are placed by room, inside the left or right chamber of the divider, so they\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:56:   - The room geometry is derived from the largest union bbox needed for input/output anchor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:57:     alignment, so both the input sprite and its swapped output fit within the same room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:65:   - Because sprites appear in both left/right rooms, the divider is not a per-room rewrite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:70:     lives in the lower scene; sprites remain inside room interiors with padding.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:91:     two-room layout. A D15-only solver that ignores only the legend should fail on these\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:213:    Decode the edge legend, ignore the room-divider structure, then swap each sprite to the opposite structure.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:217:    - A large monochrome frame-plus-divider structure partitions the lower scene into left/right rooms.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:218:    - Inside those rooms are exactly 3 sprite instances at integer scales. Every sprite contains color 1 and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:497:def _room_free_location(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:500:    room: tuple[int, int, int, int],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:503:    \"\"\"Place a marker inside one room interior using the shared reserve grid.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:504:    r0, c0, r1, c1 = room\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:554:    for curr_type, scale, _room_name in instances:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:560:    need_room_w = max(union_widths)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:561:    need_room_h = max(union_heights)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:564:    min_n = max(GRID_SIZE_MIN, LEGEND_SHAPE[1] + 2, need_room_h + top + 5, 2 * need_room_w + 9)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:572:    divider_min = need_room_w + 4\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:573:    divider_max = n - 5 - need_room_w\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:578:    left_room = (top + 2, left + 2, bottom - 2, divider_c - 2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:579:    right_room = (top + 2, divider_c + 2, bottom - 2, right - 2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:580:    if left_room[0] > left_room[2] or left_room[1] > left_room[3]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:582:    if right_room[0] > right_room[2] or right_room[1] > right_room[3]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:600:    rooms = {\"left\": left_room, \"right\": right_room}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:601:    room_usage = {\"left\": 0, \"right\": 0}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:602:    for curr_type, scale, room_name in instances:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:608:            ur, uc = _room_free_location(reserve, marker, rooms[room_name], bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:620:        room_usage[room_name] += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/13/code.py:622:    if min(room_usage.values()) < 1:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:277:    assert left[\"bbox\"][3] < right[\"bbox\"][1], \"paired sprites must leave a horizontal corridor\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:286:    assert c0 <= c1, \"trail corridor must have positive width\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:357:    - After all position exchanges are defined, drop every moved sprite straight down until it hits the floor or a previously settled sprite, then draw a split-color trail across the pair's original corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:360:    - The stable combinational object is not a recolored patch but the whole observed sprite plus its anchor. The anchor recovers prototype identity for pairing, defines the exchanged destination, and also pins the original horizontal corridor where the lingering trail must be drawn after gravity has pulled the moved sprites away.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:512:def _trail_has_clear_final_corridor(landed_board: np.ndarray, trail: dict, bg: int) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/23/code.py:566:de