.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:22:#      noise. So the visible input is \"three frame-like colors, but only two actually close rooms\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:23:#    - Small trace: if blue encloses 2 rooms, red encloses 5 rooms, and yellow is an open comb,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:25:#      has exactly those three colors; `main()` measures room counts [2, 5, 0], keeps blue/red,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:36:#      always have distinct room counts. This keeps the rule human-readable from few examples:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:37:#      identify the two closed structures, count their rooms, sort ascending.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:44:#    - Filtering `rooms > 0` assumes the distractor never accidentally forms a cycle. The comb\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:47:#    - Sorting only by room count assumes the two valid frames do not tie. Generator samples\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:48:#      distinct room counts and validates the exact expected output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:70:#    - Hallmark combo metric: every accepted sample must have exactly one zero-room color among the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:76:#    - `main()` asserts that there are exactly two positive-room colors and one zero-room color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:78:#    - `main()` assumes room-count order is strict. `generate_input()` samples distinct counts.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:148:    Convert the two genuine partitioned frames into horizontal bars whose lengths equal their enclosed-room counts.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:153:    - The remaining color is an open frame-like distractor made of line segments; it may cross a true frame but never closes a room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:158:    - Keep the two colors with positive room counts, sort them by room count ascending, and use the unique zero-room color as output padding.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:161:    - The decisive test is closure: among three frame-like colors, exactly one stays open after reconstruction and therefore contributes only the padding color, while the other two behave like the original room-count frames.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:169:        rooms, walls = _analyze_color(g, int(color))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:170:        counts.append((int(color), int(rooms), walls))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:173:    drawings = [(color, rooms, walls) for color, rooms, walls in counts if rooms > 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:174:    pad_colors = [color for color, rooms, _walls in counts if rooms == 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:181:    width = max(rooms for _color, rooms, _walls in ordered)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:184:    for r, (color, rooms, _walls) in enumerate(ordered):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:185:        out[r, :rooms] = int(color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:223:def _build_frame(target_rooms: int, max_h: int = 22, max_w: int = 25) -> np.ndarray | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:224:    if target_rooms == 1:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:239:            if target_rooms <= cells <= target_rooms + 4:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:245:                if cells >= target_rooms:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:278:    cells_to_merge = total_cells - target_rooms\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:332:    if _count_enclosed_regions(walls) != target_rooms:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:455:    for (_color, _rooms, mask), (r0, c0) in zip(frames, positions):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:515:def _expected_output(room_counts: list[int], frame_colors: list[int], pad_color: int) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:516:    ordered = sorted(zip(room_counts, frame_colors))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:519:    for r, (rooms, color) in enumerate(ordered):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:520:        out[r, :rooms] = int(color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:525:    room_counts = random.sample(list(range(_ROOM_COUNT_RANGE[0], _ROOM_COUNT_RANGE[1] + 1)), _FRAME_COUNT)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:534:    for color, target_rooms in zip(frame_colors, room_counts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:535:        frame_data = _build_frame(target_rooms, max_h=_FRAME_MAX_H, max_w=_FRAME_MAX_W)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:541:        frames.append((int(color), int(target_rooms), frame_data))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/12/code.py:575:    expected = _expected_output(room_counts, frame_colors, distractor_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:18:#    - 原题依赖显式的 8/5/9 管道组件；这里把中部改成“迷宫走廊”，走廊本身是背景 0，墙是统一的 2 色，因此 solver 不再顺着现成管道追踪，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:38:#    - 若只做“迷宫最短路”，样例会退化成普通配对路径题；因此必须让最短路同时经过 1-marker 直行点、3-marker 反射点和至少一个 9 旋转门。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:53:#      4. 迷宫是单像素宽走廊，因此除特殊节点外不会出现大量等长分支。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:452:    Route paired tokens through a shortest-path maze whose crossings reflect and whose maroon gates rotate the delivered shape.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:455:    - The board is mostly walls and background corridors rather than prebuilt cyan pipes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:457:    - Some corridor centers carry diagonal 5 markers, and some isolated non-square 9 rectangles sit directly on straight corridor segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:460:    - Find the shortest route from each source-side endpoint to its same-colored anchor endpoint through background corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:572:def _build_corridor_network(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/27/code.py:887:    slot_wire, bypass_wire, straight_marker_count, turn_marker_count = _build_corridor_network(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D17/1/code.py:222:    \"\"\"Sample heights with enough room and with both parities represented.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:20:#   of its perpendicular extension corridor: short -> red (2), medium -> yellow (4),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:34:# - Placement legality: the generator reserves every full diagonal corridor touched by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:39:#   on empty corridors. This avoids ambiguous overdraw while still exposing three\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:190:    - Active trigger seeds on that path do not stay magenta: their output color is red, yellow, or green according to the total length of their perpendicular diagonal extension corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:303:        corridor = _full_ray_cells(pos, perp_dirs, H, W)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:304:        if corridor & occupied:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:306:        if corridor & reserved:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:308:        total_len = len(corridor)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/16/code.py:309:        scored.append((pos, corridor, total_len, _trigger_bin_index(total_len)))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/4/code.py:20:#   regions. Example: a 2x2 room frame with one divider produced 2 rooms.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/4/code.py:24:#   length 3. The counted primitive changes from \"background room bounded by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/4/code.py:48:#   rooms. D4/0 breaks that premise completely, so the new solver uses black as\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:21:#    左组两条通道在逻辑上做 2-cycle，右组两条通道也做 2-cycle。像素层面上，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:22:#    D20/0 禁止共享线段，所以每条通道都画成自己的独立连通分量；cycle 由\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:35:#    - 原 main() 假设一整个 connected component 可以含多条通道和交叉；这里\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:36:#      不再成立，所以 solver 改为把每个独立 wire component 当作一条单独通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/9/code.py:18:#   - D11/0 removes direction guessing. A thin arrow is drawn in the corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/9/code.py:69:#   - The arrow is drawn only in the corridor between the chosen pair and never\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/9/code.py:87:#     shared singleton = anchor, isolated corridor component = direction marker,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:18:# - Original 89565ca0 used colored rectilinear room-frames. Solver reconstructed wall\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:19:#   grids, counted enclosed background rooms, then emitted same-color bars whose length\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:20:#   matched that room count.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:23:#   nesting depth k rather than a hidden room count.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:27:#   original: room counts [1, 3, 4] -> bar lengths [1, 3, 4].\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:30:#   difference 1: the counted thing changes from \"enclosed rooms\" to \"nested shells\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:44:# - Original \"count value = enclosed rooms\" is no longer semantically correct; the combo\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:51:# - Original `out[r, :rooms] = color` and `width = max(rooms...)` both encode direct\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/5/code.py:64:#   concentric squares rather than room partitions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/28/code.py:89:# Larger canvas than the seed task to leave room around a wider grid legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/3/code.py:17:#      远端得到 X，少数反向通道则由 X 源补出 diamond。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/3/code.py:34:#    - 迷宫结构仍控制在 2-4 条横向障碍带，且门只在左右两侧交替出现，保证 BFS 结果清晰、可从少量样例归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/3/code.py:334:    Route each token through an empty maze and rotate its delivered complement at 9-gates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/3/code.py:345:    Key insight: Color still pairs the two sites, but the actual output depends on two coupled inferences: which shortest maze route is forced by the 5-bands, and what net rotation that route accumulates from the sequence of 9-gates it passes through.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/6/code.py:66:     but the bar layout only needs room for `max_count` consecutive cells after `key_col`.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/6/code.py:71:   - The legend is placed with a margin from the grid edges, preserving room for sprites.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D4/0/code.py:274:    \"\"\"Sample widths that leave room for a separator and a sprite field.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/21/code.py:62:#    - Each active trigger is chosen from `path[2:-2]`, guaranteeing room for the two same-diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/30/code.py:65:#       five per key need substantially more packing room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/16/code.py:26:#    - Original: one long 4-connected hole corridor, 7-15 medium/small sprites, global size-only packing.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/16/code.py:53:#      That is a strong visible departure from the original \"many fragments in one corridor\" regime.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/16/code.py:69:    - Inside that strip, the missing cells are not one corridor anymore: they form 2-3 separate\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D4/2/code.py:42:#       the target is no longer a 1D stripe with implicit infinite horizontal room; it is a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:11:# - 一个具体小例子：某条交换横线从第 1 列通道连到第 4 列通道。第 1 列和第 4 列的结点本地都同时有“直行向下”和“拐入横线”两种可能。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:13:#   说明这里不是继续直落，而是离开主干拐入或拐出横线。内部被横线跨过的中间通道仍是裸 '+'，因此依然按直行优先穿过。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:14:# - 差异：输入里同时存在“无标记直行”的裸 '+' 与“远距成对 5 触发转弯”的少数结点，两者必须协同才能恢复通道置换。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:17:# - 保留 4-5 条通道、非恒等置换、0-3 个 9 号矩形宽接合体，避免图像退化成单次简单弯折。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:18:# - 每个样例强制至少有一条跨越至少 3 个通道中心的交换横线，从而保证至少出现一个裸露的内部 '+'，否则 D2/1 不可观察。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:29:# - token 仍与端点相隔 2 格，通道间距仍为 4-5，因此 3x3 token 不会互相重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/21/code.py:41:#    - The hole union is still a single 4-connected corridor-like region, but its subparts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:18:#    - 一个具体例子：某条水平槽从左往右穿过中间通道列 c。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:40:#    - 通道列仍按 4-5 列间距布置，水平槽只在 crossover row 出现；这样交叉夹子 (c-1,c+1) 不会和相邻通道混叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D6/2/code.py:198:    \"\"\"Sample bar heights that leave enough room for the sprite top area.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/19/code.py:71:#    The generator keeps the original corridor-like stacked-rectangle template so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/19/code.py:430:def _corridor_rects(long: int, thick: int, count: int) -> list[tuple[int, int, int, int]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/19/code.py:728:    canon = _corridor_rects(long, thick, total)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D3/1/code.py:38:#    - reserve 仍覆盖完整 route corridor，可避免多 triple 时虚线空档和别的对象交错。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/18/code.py:56:     corridors, and draws bridges only on background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/18/code.py:67:   - Only three layers remain: frames, empty bridge corridors, and one sparse control row. No symbols are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:7:#    - 保留原题对象: 端点外侧 2 格处的 3x3 token、由 8/5/9 组成的正交管道、以及 9-rect 宽通道块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:22:#    - 生成器强制保留 4-5 个通道、非恒等置换和至少一个真实顺序冲突，避免样本退化成“只是 D3 连续涂色”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c4d067a0/15/code.py:34:#       exhausting placement room or making the board unreadable.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/4/code.py:258:def _corridor_rects(long: int, thick: int, count: int) -> list[tuple[int, int, int, int]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/4/code.py:415:    canon = _corridor_rects(long, thick, total)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:17:#    - 一个具体轨迹：若顶部有 color-1 solid，连到某条通道并沿路穿过 2 个 9-rect，那么输出顶部中心\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:23:#    - 为了让“颜色决定分解”在少量样例里可见，我不再要求每条通道颜色互异，而是固定 4 条通道中有\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:38:#    - token 仍然放在 degree-1 端点外 2 格的 3x3 框中；通道列、上下 token 行、交叉行都沿用原题几何，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:45:#    - 解题者在单个样例里就能看到：同为 color 1 的两条通道都留下 X，而同为 color 6 的两条通道都\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/23/code.py:56:#    - 源颜色只用两种，并且每种颜色都在样例内重复，避免把“颜色决定分解”退化成四条通道各不相同的孤例。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/25/code.py:54:#   corridor and never overlaps a frame or the control row.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/25/code.py:69:#   reversing direction changes which frame color paints each corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:17:# - 融合后保留 token 形状语义，但每条通道在靠近顶部端点的竖直主干上都嵌入一个 9 号矩形过滤器。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:31:#   因此 generator 约束为“每个源通道恰好一个单线过滤块，且位于第一次 crossover 之前”，这样每个 token 的阻断原因唯一。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:38:# - 原 generator 允许 0-3 个 9 块且它们与通道关系松散；这里新 solver 默认“每个 token 的路径上至多出现一个决定性的过滤块”，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/13/code.py:72:#      is a single corridor-like connected region inside the strip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/13/code.py:425:def _corridor_rects(long: int, thick: int, count: int) -> list[tuple[int, int, int, int]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/13/code.py:683:    canon = _corridor_rects(long, thick, total)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/6/code.py:59:#    - Each endpoint window contains at most one slab or one solid block; wires stay in the interior corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/22/code.py:198:    \"\"\"Partition total corridor length into count positive lengths.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/22/code.py:246:def _corridor_rects(long: int, thick: int, count: int) -> list[tuple[int, int, int, int]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/22/code.py:247:    \"\"\"Generate connected rectangles whose union forms the hole corridor.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/22/code.py:404:    rects_canon = _corridor_rects(long, thick, total)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/4/code.py:17:#   若通道列是 [c0,c1,c2,c3,c4]，第 1 层交换 (c0,c1),(c2,c3)，第 2 层交换 (c1,c2),(c3,c4)，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/4/code.py:34:# - 通道间距固定为 4。这样既能容纳 45 度对角线，又能在 26x26 以内放下 3 层交换带、上下 token 和偶发 9-rect。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/6/code.py:257:    \"\"\"Attach dot-sized rectangles adjacent to existing corridor rectangles.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/6/code.py:273:def _corridor_rects(long: int, thick: int, count: int, dots: int) -> list[tuple[int, int, int, int, bool]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/6/code.py:454:    canon = _corridor_rects(long, thick, total - dots, dots)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/5/code.py:20:#      “solid / X 是两类源态”，再看出“solid 的被传输部分比 X 通道多一个中心像素”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/5/code.py:22:#    - 继续保留 4-5 条通道、非恒等置换、0-3 个 9-矩形与跨线标记，避免任务退化成直接上下复制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/5/code.py:49:#    - 假设每个颜色只对应一条通道，不会出现同色源 token 争用同一导线分量；generator 继续为每条通道分配独立颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:3:# Name: 不等间距通道+可变尺寸token\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:16:#    原题里每个 token 都是固定 3x3，中心离端点固定 2 格，通道列距也几乎恒定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:19:#    2. 同一条物理通道两端保持同尺寸，所以“尺寸”是通道属性，不是一次性的输入噪声；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:20:#    3. 相邻通道中心距不再统一，而是由相邻尺寸决定：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:22:#    这样大 token 会稳定出现在更宽的通道带里，尺寸-间距对应关系在同一张图里就能观察到。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:24:#    若第 3 条 5x5 通道在底端放一个实心块，solver 应把它在原位拆成同尺寸的十字轮廓，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:30:#    通道数保持 4-5 条，尺寸配置固定为 [3,3,5,5] 或 [3,3,3,5,5]，这样同一尺寸会重复出现，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:31:#    人眼能在 2-4 个样例里看出“大 token 的通道更宽、离端点更远”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:42:#    叠加后的新冲突是：如果置换把 3x3 token 送进 5x5 通道，会出现“尺寸-通道属性”矛盾。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:54:#    - 大 token 聚集的通道间距也更大。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/14/code.py:58:#    通道只做上下布局，不引入额外干扰元素；尺寸只用两档；相邻 bbox 保持 1 列空白；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/24/code.py:20:#    same lattice row, the output draws only the center row of the corridor, not the whole\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/24/code.py:37:#      one-pixel centerline, so only the central row or column of the corridor is painted.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/24/code.py:55:#    contains no bridges. In the output, bridge lines occupy only empty corridors, avoiding the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D5/1/code.py:3:# Change: 源为8像素的空心菱形轮廓（5x5外接矩形中的对角线位置像素）... → 十字形（加号形状）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D18/2/code.py:9:#     grid: square, now effectively 10-27 to leave room for a legend in the top-left corner\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/31/code.py:59:#    - Generator samples left/right widths so both halves have room for bars and dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/3/code.py:34:  a 1-cell-thick corridor because the smaller endpoint is 1 cell wide.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/3/code.py:67:frames, and non-empty bridge corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/3/code.py:94:  center, and bridge corridors are non-empty.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D5/2/code.py:55:#    - The solver assumes the alternating-gap trajectory has enough room to display the pattern; 