 crucial change is inside the maze body. Instead of building vertical\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:62:#    - `_has_corridor(...)` encoded the old task's semantic gate. It is kept only\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:66:#        b) at least one perpendicular cell being a same-color corridor;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:78:#           perpendicular corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:84:#    - Columns satisfy `2 < x2 < x3 < x1 < W-1`, leaving room for blockers and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:92:#      clockwise spiral rather than at old-style matched L/U corridor endpoints.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:106:#      terminates instead of entering another corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:135:def _has_corridor(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:136:    \"\"\"Original-task corridor predicate, kept only for degeneration checks.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:222:            if _has_corridor(grid, tr, tc, turn_dir):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D2/0/code.py:248:    \"\"\"Move selected particles through the striped maze using fixed clockwise turns.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D13/0/code.py:24:#     - 设源通道 A 在更上方，源通道 B 在其下方，二者都通过各自的 U-turn 进入同一目标通道 T。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D13/0/code.py:35:#   - _has_corridor 原本把 PARTICLE 当作可站立单元，这在原题无害，因为路径内部只有起点列含粒子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D13/0/code.py:46:#   - 特制级联结构使用两个上方源通道 + 一个下方目标通道，中间插入一个 fake spacer channel，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D13/0/code.py:47:#     防止 target 入口被打断后反过来破坏紧邻上方源通道的入口合法性。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D13/0/code.py:48:#   - 两个源通道使用不同的垂直列进入同一目标通道，肉眼能直接看到“共享尾段”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/cod