e.py:29:        1. 水平通道内, 让粒子提前停下.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:30:        2. 水平通道拐弯口前方, 让粒子因撞块而转入竖直走廊.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:31:        3. 竖直通道内, 让粒子在竖直段中途停下.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:43:        - 旧任务里视觉上更像条带结构本身制造障碍; 新任务里单格块是独立对象, 人眼能直接看到“通道不再畅通”.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:49:    - _has_corridor 假设“合法转弯入口格必须是BG/粒子且两侧同色”. 变体不改这一点, 所以孤立块只需要充当前方障碍, 不需要自己编码方向.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:51:    - main 的入口检测假设真实通道起点仍然由最左侧同色条对定义. 变体不能在入口左侧乱放块, 否则会把“哪几行是可追踪真实走廊”弄乱.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:56:    - 竖直停止块只放在竖直通道经过的奇数行上, 这样它是单格块, 且粒子撞到后左右都没有合法水平走廊.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:57:    - 竖直通道列仍用窗口保留法避免重叠, 各种块都不越界.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:60:    - 多个真实通道会包含这种块, 且有的导致转弯、有的导致内部停止, 规则不是偶然个例.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:62:    - 仍保持偶数行长条 + 奇数行通道的整齐结构, 只在通道内添加少量单格块.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:74:    \"\"\"Return the first valid real-corridor entrance column for row r.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:98:def _has_corridor(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:144:            if 0 <= tr < H and 0 <= tc < W and _has_corridor(grid, tr, tc, turn_dir):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D8/3/code.py:165:    \"\"\"Move particles through same-color corridors; any colored blocker can redirect or stop them.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/46/code.py:32:#      not corridor length, controls the ranking.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/46/code.py:63:#      close to the center disappear even when a shorter corridor leads to a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/46/code.py:170:      unique red center, plus magenta walls that create corridor detours.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/46/code.py:184:    - Reachability still depends on corridor connectivity, but priority no\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/46/code.py:185:      longer depends on corridor length.  A maroon that is geometrically close\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:14:#    Example corridor: dest -> orange -> maroon A -> maroon B -> orange -> maroon C.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:20:#    The generator uses 2-3 thin corridors plus 0-2 isolated distractors. That is enough to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:30:#    Corridors and rooms are carved from a wall field by fixed templates, so cells never overlap\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:36:#    Tokens are only placed on corridor/room cells. Distractors live in isolated corner pockets, so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:61:        {\"path\": [(5, 3), (5, 2), (5, 1), (5, 0)], \"room\": [(4, 0), (6, 0)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:62:        {\"path\": [(5, 3), (5, 2), (4, 2), (3, 2), (2, 2), (1, 2)], \"room\": [(0, 2), (1, 1)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:63:        {\"path\": [(5, 3), (5, 2), (6, 2), (7, 2), (8, 2), (9, 2)], \"room\": [(10, 2), (9, 1)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:66:        {\"path\": [(5, 7), (5, 8), (5, 9), (5, 10)], \"room\": [(4, 10), (6, 10)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:67:        {\"path\": [(5, 7), (5, 8), (4, 8), (3, 8), (2, 8), (1, 8)], \"room\": [(0, 8), (1, 9)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:68:        {\"path\": [(5, 7), (5, 8), (6, 8), (7, 8), (8, 8), (9, 8)], \"room\": [(10, 8), (9, 9)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:71:        {\"path\": [(3, 5), (2, 5), (1, 5), (0, 5)], \"room\": [(0, 4), (0, 6)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:72:        {\"path\": [(3, 5), (2, 5), (1, 5), (1, 4), (1, 3)], \"room\": [(0, 3), (1, 2)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:73:        {\"path\": [(3, 5), (2, 5), (1, 5), (1, 6), (1, 7)], \"room\": [(0, 7), (1, 8)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:76:        {\"path\": [(7, 5), (8, 5), (9, 5), (10, 5)], \"room\": [(10, 4), (10, 6)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:77:        {\"path\": [(7, 5), (8, 5), (9, 5), (9, 4), (9, 3)], \"room\": [(10, 3), (9, 2)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:78:        {\"path\": [(7, 5), (8, 5), (9, 5), (9, 6), (9, 7)], \"room\": [(10, 7), (9, 8)]},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:213:    - Maroon tokens are no longer part of the traversable corridor; they are movable plugs. Removing a front\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:244:        cells = tuple(layout[\"path\"] + layout[\"room\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:250:        _carve_cells(grid, layout[\"room\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:256:    chain_room = list(layouts[chain_dir][\"room\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:264:    token_cells.add(random.choice(chain_room))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:269:        room = list(layouts[d][\"room\"])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:270:        count = random.randint(1, len(room))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:271:        token_cells.update(random.sample(room, count))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/19/code.py:281:        protected.add(next(iter(set(chain_room) & token_cells)))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:25:#   suppose a corridor opens on the right and another on the top. A token at (4,8) can be reached from the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:27:#   visually near the center but only after a long detour through the top opening and a bent corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:72:#   as one central container plus corridors instead of unrelated clutter.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:251:    - Maroon tokens are scattered on floor cells outside the block; some may be cut off by wall corridors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:261:    - Reachability still depends on corridor connectivity, but selection is no longer based on path length.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/6/code.py:262:      A token can win because it is geometrically closer to the center even if the corridor route to it is longer.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:14:#     reason_for_sidebar: 原题 col0 是粒子列、col1 是通道前的缓冲列，不能拿来编码；把编码挪到最右侧最稳妥，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:33:#     - 每张图仍保留 3-6 条真实通道，且至少 2 条路径被步数上限截断，至少 1 条在拐弯后才被截断，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:48:#     - 侧栏墙色不参与任何走廊颜色集合，solver 也把入口搜索限制在走廊区，因此不会把侧栏误判为通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:73:def _has_corridor(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:97:    \"\"\"Find the first real corridor cell for row r inside the walkable region.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:151:            if 0 <= tr < H and 0 <= tc < W and _has_corridor(grid, tr, tc, turn_dir):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:174:    \"\"\"Move magenta particles along corridors, but stop after at most N visible steps.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:240:    \"\"\"Reserve a 3-column window for a vertical corridor and return its wall column.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:3:# Name: 8连通可达+墙壁通道口+规则框架\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/17/code.py:57:#   planner that explicitly reserves room for many reflections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:10:#     - 颜色 8/5/9 的导线网络、crossing 标记、9 矩形通道、置换式路由全部保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:11:#     - token 仍然放在导线端点外侧 2 格处，使用各通道独立颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:34:#     - 仍保留 4-5 条通道、非恒等置换、crossing 与 9 矩形，使任务复杂度主要仍来自配线追踪，而不是 token 识别噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:41:#     - 不同通道颜色互异，token 之间不会重叠；输出端也是既定 top/bottom 锚点，不覆盖导线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D1/0/code.py:4:#         （corridor_following + inertia）→ 直线射线路径（straight ray）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D1/0/code.py:29:       corridor cells and may turn into a vertical lane.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D1/0/code.py:52:   - The old solver's correctness relied on `_has_corridor()` and on there being at\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D1/0/code.py:76:     readable instead of becoming a dense maze.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D1/0/code.py:232:    \"\"\"Prefer a direction with at least some visible room.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:33:#    输入输出会退化成原题。因此 generator 强制至少 2 条真实入口通道在中途变成短假走廊补丁，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:34:#    让新终点在 2-4 个样例里肉眼可见。其余通道仍保留直行 / L / U 的原始风格，避免任务过度简化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:36:#    - 入口筛选依赖“最左侧真正可进入的通道在起始列附近必须是同色条对”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:41:#      变体只把假走廊变成终点，不把它变成可转入的新路径，所以 _has_corridor 仍只认真走廊。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:43:#    真实入口通道选择为“尽量互不相邻”的奇数行通道，原因是相邻通道共享一条横条。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:44:#    假终点补丁要改写某一侧横条的颜色；若两个活动真通道相邻，会互相破坏对方的结构。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:50:#    假终点补丁只在单条活动水平通道上做 2-4 列短色块，不叠加额外标记，不改变粒子颜色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:51:#    仍保留清晰的条带结构。活动通道彼此隔开，减少共享边界导致的视觉噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:59:#    - _corridor_kind 只在当前格是 BG/粒子且两侧都在网格内时有意义；generator 的假终点补丁放在内部列。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:60:#    - trace 假设入口通道起步是真走廊；generator 保证 bar_start 到补丁前保持同色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:61:#    - main 仍可能在多粒子场景下并行写输出；generator 通过分离通道与唯一终点设计，避免两个粒子争同一终点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:64:def _corridor_flanks(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> tuple[int, int] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:78:def _corridor_kind(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> str:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:80:    flanks = _corridor_flanks(grid, r, c, direction)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:89:def _has_corridor(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:90:    \"\"\"True iff (r,c) is a real corridor cell flanked by same-color bars.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:91:    return _corridor_kind(grid, r, c, direction) == \"real\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:105:            if _corridor_kind(grid, r, c, direction) == \"fake\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:112:            if 0 <= tr < H and 0 <= tc < W and _has_corridor(grid, tr, tc, turn_dir):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:118:        if _corridor_kind(grid, r, c, direction) == \"fake\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:124:    \"\"\"Return the first genuine horizontal corridor entrance for row r.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:139:    \"\"\"Move particles through real corridors; entering a fake corridor stops them.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:217:    \"\"\"Reserve a 3-column window for a vertical corridor wall column.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:233:    \"\"\"Reserve at least two active channels for the new fake-corridor endpoint.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/3/code.py:470:    \"\"\"Turn part of a real horizontal corridor into a short fake-corridor endpoint.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:3:# Name: 迷宫式墙壁+加权距离背景\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:24:#   token on a 6-step route always beat one on an 8-step route. Here the maze\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:25:#   still gates reachability, but there are two corridor colors: orange costs 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:33:#   opaque arithmetic. The maze is a single-cell corridor system with dead ends,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:44:#   The generator starts from a wall field, carves a non-overlapping corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:45:#   maze, keeps exactly one opening adjacent to the 3x3 target block, and places\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:64:    MAROON: 1,  # generator places maroons on orange corridor endpoints\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:203:    - Magenta walls carve the board into a narrow maze.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:204:    - Orange and grey corridor cells are both traversable; scattered maroon pixels sit on corridor endpoints.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:207:    - Start from corridor cells adjacent to the destination block and search through orange, grey, and maroon cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:212:    Key insight: The maze still controls reachability, but shortest step count is no longer enough:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:219:def _base_maze() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:257:    grid = _base_maze()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/34/code.py:281:    raise RuntimeError(f\"failed to generate a valid maze-weighted sample after {GEN_RETRIES} attempts\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/29/code.py:82:#       trajectory visually related instead of producing an over-busy multicolor maze.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:8:#   fixed_corridor_limit: 2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:9:#   corridor_counting:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:10:#     - 起始时粒子位于最左列，但一旦进入横向通道，计作第 1 段走廊。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:17:#     - 输入布局仍是偶数行条带 / 奇数行水平通道，垂直通道仍由 bar-row 上打洞形成。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:27:#     - U/S 型路径（至少 3 段）会比原题少走最后一段，因此终点常落在网格内部的竖直通道末端。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:35:#   - _has_corridor() 假设可通行格只能是 BG 或粒子色；变体未改变，仍成立。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:38:#   - main() 的入口检测假设真实通道从列 2/3 附近开始，且上下条带同色；变体不改入口定义，仍成立。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:42:#   - generator 仍使用不重叠的竖直通道列窗口分配，避免两个转弯结构共享同一竖井。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:49:#   - 校验要求至少两个粒子命中 corridor limit，防止样本退化回原题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:76:def _has_corridor(grid: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, direction: str) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:97:    max_corridors: int | None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:102:    If max_corridors is None, this matches the original unlimited behavior.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:103:    Otherwise, the particle may enter at most `max_corridors` straight corridor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:104:    segments. At a would-be turn into segment `max_corridors + 1`, it stops on\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:109:    corridors_used = 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:126:            if 0 <= tr < H and 0 <= tc < W and _has_corridor(grid, tr, tc, turn_dir):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:132:        if max_corridors is not None and corridors_used >= max_corridors:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:136:        corridors_used += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:141:            \"corridors_used\": corridors_used,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:149:    \"\"\"Return the first valid horizontal corridor entrance for row r.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:168:    \"\"\"Move particles through at most two corridor segments.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:176:        end_r, end_c = _trace(g, r, 0, max_corridors=MAX_CORRIDORS)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:209:    \"\"\"Reserve a 3-column window for one vertical corridor.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:354:        old_r, old_c, old_meta = _trace(grid, r, 0, max_corridors=None, return_stats=True)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/2/code.py:356:            grid, r, 0, max_corridors=MAX_CORRIDORS, return_stats=True\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:338:                    need_room = 3 if future_bounces == 0 else 2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:339:                    if _max_diag_steps(H, W, bounce_r, bounce_c, new_dr, new_dc) < need_room:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/1/code.py:47:#    because token centers already had room for a full 3x3 in the original task.\n/home/lixinyu/sna