47bf94d/D11/0/code.py:41:#     - 保留 4-5 条通道和非恒等置换，避免样例退化成无交叉直线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/0/code.py:43:#     - crossover 列至少间隔 2，通道行至少间隔 4，保证 5-marker 与 token 可分辨\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/0/code.py:51:#     - 通道行由 top_margin + k * spacing 生成，bypass 行与最后一条通道相距 2，避免 5-marker 覆盖 bypass\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/0/code.py:64:#     - 每条通道左右各有一个度为 1 的 endpoint\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:3:# Change: 高度 = 框架颜色数，宽度 = 最大封闭区域数... → 宽度 = 所有房间数之和\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:20:#     frame_rule: each frame encloses 1-6 rooms after wall reconstruction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:21:#     tie_rule: equal room counts are still broken by cover order on overlaps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:23:#     original: one row per frame, width = max(room_count), right-padded by noise color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:24:#     variant: a single row, width = sum(room_count over all true frames)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:25:#     encoding: after sorting frames by room count (and overlap order for ties),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:26:#       emit each frame as a solid color segment of exactly its room count, with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:36:#     difference: sorting and room counting are identical; only the final\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:47:#     - rooms == 0 still uniquely identifies the noise color; generator keeps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:48:#       exactly one non-frame color and never creates zero-room real frames\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:52:#       code that used max(room_count) and row indexing must be replaced\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D8/1/code.py:61:#       horizontal string of 