ounts: list[int],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:510:    frame_info = sorted((room_counts[i], render_order.index(i), frame_colors[i]) for i in range(len(frame_colors)))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:511:    max_rooms = max(rc for rc, _, _ in frame_info)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:512:    expected = np.full((len(frame_colors), max_rooms), pad_color, dtype=int)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:528:        room_counts = chosen + [random.choice(chosen)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:532:        room_counts = random.sample(available, frame_count)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:533:    random.shuffle(room_counts)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:545:    for color, target_rooms in zip(frame_colors, room_counts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:546:        frame_data = _build_frame(target_rooms, max_h=f_max_h, max_w=f_max_w)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:552:        frames.append((color, target_rooms, frame_data))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:567:        if room_counts[i] == room_counts[j]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:576:        if room_counts[i] != room_counts[j]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D4/3/code.py:606:    expected = _expected_output(room_counts, frame_colors, render_order, distractor_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/0/code.py:3:# Change: 轴对齐的1像素厚彩色线绘制的分区框架，包含水平和垂直线段形成网格状房间结构... → 实心彩色矩形带内部洞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/0/code.py:18:# - Original objects were sparse 1px wall networks; room counting worked by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/0/code.py:23:#   splits into 2 enclosed rooms.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/0/code.py:27:#   but the counted primitive is now a hole rather than a line-bounded room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D11 — 通道数量与空间布局 (meta)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/2/code.py:3:# Change: 4-5个通道，均匀列间距4-5，顶部和底部放置token行，管道竖直为主加横向交叉段... → 不等间距通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/2/code.py:38:#       - generator must guarantee enough horizontal room for the growing gaps and for crossover markers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/2/code.py:43:#       and leaves room for crossing markers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D11/2/code.py:66:#     - each live wire component must still have endpoints whose outward side has room for a 3x3 token\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:3:# Change: 轴对齐的1像素厚彩色线绘制的分区框架，包含水平和垂直线段形成网格状房间结构... → 嵌套彩色方框\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:18:# - Original D3 objects were rectilinear room-partition frames. Their count value was\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:19:#   the number of enclosed background rooms after reconstructing damaged grid walls.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:27:#   original: a color with a 2x3 wall grid could enclose 4 rooms, so solver rebuilt\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:32:#   difference: the counted entity changes from \"background rooms produced by walls\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:49:#   no longer a room partition frame.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:50:# - Original \"rooms == 0 means noise color\" remains valid after replacement, provided\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:66:#   depth. This is directly visible, unlike the original hidden \"room count\" criterion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:81:# - The new hallmark metric is \"nested layer count per real color\", not enclosed rooms.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D3/2/code.py:264:    - The meaningful quantity is no longer the number of rooms inside a line grid. Each true object directly encodes its value as the number of nested same-color square borders, while the scattered pad color never forms a coherent square shell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D7 — 变换：房间数到条长的映射 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:3:# Change: 直接映射：色条长度 = 封闭区域数量... → 长度 = 最大房间数 - 当前房间数 + 1（取反映射）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:20:#     - 每个真实线框经重建后仍对应一个 1..6 的封闭房间数；房间数升序排序、同房间数仍按覆盖关系打破平局。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:22:#     - 原题输出第 r 行的彩条长度等于该线框的房间数 rooms。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:23:#     - 变体改为先求所有真实线框的最大房间数 max_rooms，再输出长度\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:24:#       inv_len = max_rooms - rooms + 1。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:25:#     - 因而房间最多的框架变成最短条，房间最少的框架变成最长条；排序不变，只反转“计数到长度”的映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:27:#     - 例：三个框房间数分别为 [1, 3, 4]，升序后颜色顺序不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:29:#     - 本变体中 max_rooms = 4，所以条长变为 [4, 2, 1]。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:33:#     - 反转映射只依赖同一张图里对象之间“谁房间更多”的相对关系，人类可从 2-4 个样例中观察到：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:34:#       排在上面的少房间框反而得到更长条，排在下面的多房间框反而更短。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:35:#     - 为避免退化成原题，生成器仍随机产生 3-5 个框且常含多个不同房间数；在这些情况下新旧输出必然不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:37:#     - colors_present / _room_count_for_color / _walls_for_color 只假设每个非背景色要么是一个可重建线框，要么是噪声色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:39:#     - drawings = rooms > 0, pad_colors = rooms == 0 依赖“恰有一种噪声色没有封闭区域”；生成器继续保证此条件。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:40:#     - _cover_order 只在同房间数组内使用，依赖有真实像素重叠时可从可见颜色判断上下层；D7 不影响。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:41:#     - 原题 `out[r, :rooms] = color` 隐含“条长直接等于 rooms”；这里必须替换为反向长度，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:43:#     - 原题 `width = max(rooms...)` 隐含“最大条长就是最大房间数”；变体中应改为\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:44:#       `max(inverted_lengths)`，虽然当最小房间数为 1 时两者数值相同，但语义已不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:46:#     - 生成器仍沿用原来的 output-first / oracle-check 模式：先随机房间数、建框、放置、制造重叠和噪声，再用 main 校验。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:49:#     - 输出中每一行的颜色顺序和原题一致，但条长与房间数方向相反，这是直接可见的主要线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:50:#     - 生成器不固定某一种房间数组合，因此少房间长条 / 多房间短条会在不同样例中重复出现。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:109:def _room_count_for_color(g: np.ndarray, color: int) -> int:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:133:    above: dict[int, set[int]] = {color: set() for color, _rooms, _walls in group}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:134:    indegree: dict[int, int] = {color: 0 for color, _rooms, _walls in group}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:163:def _inverse_bar_length(rooms: int, max_rooms: int) -> int:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:164:    return int(max_rooms - rooms + 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:169:    Convert each reconstructed frame into a horizontal bar whose length is inversely related to its room count within that scene.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:174:    - Each true drawing is still a rectangular wall layout enclosing one or more background rooms after reconstruction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:178:    - The color whose reconstruction encloses zero rooms is the padding/noise color; all other colors are genuine frames.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/89565ca0/D7/1/code.py:179:    - Order genuine frames by increasing room count, breaking ties by bottom-to-top cover 